{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jelly Monsters\u00a0is a hilarious competitive party game that supports up to 6 players online! Transform into an ugly-cute, quirky magnetic jelly monster and dive into a variety of chaotic, joy-filled arenas. Harness the physics of magnetic poles (N/S) and the power of special magnets to unleash rounds of hilarious, rowdy competitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.poster.avif?t=1757323885\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.webm?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.mp4?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic Properties: Pure Chaos &amp; Fun</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;like poles repel&quot; magnetic property to collect more magnets quickly, then send opponents (and maybe even teammates!) flying with a well-timed repel! Knock them into the water for extra bonus points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage &quot;opposite poles attract&quot; to snatch magnets from others and earn additional points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch your own polarity on the fly\u2014whether you\u2019re stealing magnets or defending your own, the choice is in your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.poster.avif?t=1757323885\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.webm?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.mp4?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Magnets: Every Match is Epic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble to collect or steal magnets\u2014more magnets mean higher scores and stronger magnetic combat abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each magnet has unique active or passive effects. With light roguelike elements, the thrill of stealing and being stolen adds endless unpredictability, making every brawl an adventure full of unexpected laughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659090?t=1757323885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/e1b7c6bd1e076478dc2b378fcd2df13a15b42934/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757323885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/36538f8d2779a83860604b184b5c56df5f053ade/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757323885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/36538f8d2779a83860604b184b5c56df5f053ade/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757323885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>PLAYTEST IS OPEN</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>We\u2019re currently in closed playtest! Join us and jump into this joyful magnetic arena!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>JELLY MONSTERS IS ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/77827b5515d0c18b55da599b53cb03d0.avif?t=1757323885\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jelly Monsters\u00a0is a hilarious competitive party game that supports up to 6 players online! Transform into an ugly-cute, quirky magnetic jelly monster and dive into a variety of chaotic, joy-filled arenas. Harness the physics of magnetic poles (N/S) and the power of special magnets to unleash rounds of hilarious, rowdy competitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.poster.avif?t=1757323885\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.webm?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/4aaf7014760bcecb9194fefe3784e01c.mp4?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic Properties: Pure Chaos &amp; Fun</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;like poles repel&quot; magnetic property to collect more magnets quickly, then send opponents (and maybe even teammates!) flying with a well-timed repel! Knock them into the water for extra bonus points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage &quot;opposite poles attract&quot; to snatch magnets from others and earn additional points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch your own polarity on the fly\u2014whether you\u2019re stealing magnets or defending your own, the choice is in your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.poster.avif?t=1757323885\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.webm?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/2e279d78f115dc9c5ed383452f6c1273.mp4?t=1757323885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Magnets: Every Match is Epic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble to collect or steal magnets\u2014more magnets mean higher scores and stronger magnetic combat abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each magnet has unique active or passive effects. With light roguelike elements, the thrill of stealing and being stolen adds endless unpredictability, making every brawl an adventure full of unexpected laughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BINGOBELL"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"